<title>USA: Clinton to meet Jordanian crown prince next week.</title>
<headline>Clinton to meet Jordanian crown prince next week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Bill Clinton will meet Jordan's Crown Prince Hassan at the White House next Tuesday, spokesman Mike McCurry said on Friday.</p>
<p>He said the agenda would include Middle East developments and U.S.-Jordanian economic cooperation.</p>
</text>
